meta {
  name: Get Patient Lab Tests
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/patients/:patientId/lab-tests
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  includeResults: true
}

params:path {
  patientId: {{patientId}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Gets a list of lab tests for the patient by ID. These can be downloaded via their `url` property. Partner-facing document display text fields are returned without literal `|` separators. Identifiers, URLs, statuses, dates, splice metadata, and source metadata are preserved as received.

  ### Fields

  | Field | Description |
  |---|---|
  | `includeResults` | Whether to include lab test results in the response. |
  | `patientId` | Unique identifier of the patient. |

